  <sys:String x:Key="Str.HeroPickTitle">Choose a banner for this game</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.PlayFailed">Couldn't get her started. Use Open the hold an' run the executable by hand.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.AddEmulator">Add Emulator</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.EmulatorTitle">Add an emulator</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.EmulatorBody">Pick which one, then point at the hold it sails from — the one with the executable, not the one with the ROMs.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.EmulatorOther">Another emulator</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.EmulatorOtherBody">Point at the hold an' I'll tell ye what I can make of it.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.EmulatorPick">Point at the {0} hold</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.EmulatorPickOther">Point at the emulator's hold</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.EmulatorFound">{0} spotted: {1}</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.EmulatorWrong">That don't look like {0}: no {1} in that hold. Added anyway — check yer charts.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.EmulatorUnknown">No emulator I know be in there. Added from what the files say: {0}</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.EmulatorSetting">Inside the emulator</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.ReportTitle">Not workin' in game?</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.ReportBody">Packs the logs an' the game hold's listin' into a .zip on yer PC. Nothin' be sent.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.Report">Send up a flare</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.ReportSaved">Report stowed an' the hold opened: {0}</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.ReportFailed">The report couldn't be built. The logs be in {0}</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.ReportWorking">Gatherin'…</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.DownloadReportTitle">Cargo won't come aboard?</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.DownloadReportBody">Gathers what every haul tried — each address, its name lookup, proxy an' answer — an' checks each address again now, into one .zip. Nothin' be sent: the file stays on yer PC for ye to share where ye like.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.DownloadReport">Haulin' logs</sys:String>
