  <sys:String x:Key="Str.SessionSection">Last voyage</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.SessionTip">Read from the logs the add-on an' the runtime scribble in the game's hold. Read again when ye come back to this window after sailin'.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.SessionRan">NR sailed true on the last voyage</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.SessionCrashed">The game sank on the last voyage</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.SessionFailed">NR never left port on the last voyage</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.SessionNotLoaded">ReShade set sail, but the add-on never came aboard</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.SessionNoFrames">The mod came aboard, but NR processed nary a frame</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.SessionNever">No voyage yet. Start the game once an' come back: this'll say whether NR sailed.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.SessionFrames">Frames processed: {0}</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.SessionGpu">Network: {0} ms per frame</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.SessionRuntime">Runtime {0}</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.SessionNoFramesReShade">In the game, open the ReShade overlay with Home an' check NR be on in the AMD Neural Rendering panel.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.SessionNoFramesOpti">In the game, turn on DLSS, FSR or XeSS, then press Insert, open the Neural tab an' turn on Enable NR.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.SessionNotLoadedHint">ReShade.log in the game's hold says which hold ReShade searched for add-ons. Send up a flare packs it with the rest.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.SessionReportHint">Send up a flare packs these logs into one file to share on Discord.</sys:String>
